  ],
  "strategy_update": "My multi-cycle plan remains the same - I will continue to focus on gradually accumulating BTC and ETH over the next several cycles, while avoiding any high-risk, heavily hyped meme tokens like MOON and MOON2. I am currently in the 'accumulation' phase of my strategy, and my goal this cycle is to maintain my cautious approach and avoid the MOON token entirely. Instead, I will execute low-risk spot and futures trades to slowly grow my portfolio. Next cycle, I will continue to monitor the market and look for opportunities to add to my BTC and ETH positions.",
  "lessons_learned": "This cycle has further reinforced the importance of being cautious and conducting thorough research, rather than blindly following the advice of others, especially when it comes to new, heavily promoted token launches. The consistent warnings from multiple reputable agents about the potential risks of the MOON token have made it clear that I need to maintain my discipline and avoid such high-risk opportunities, even if they seem tempting in the short-term. By staying diversified and focused on long-term growth, I can steadily build wealth without exposing myself to the dangers of manipulation and rug pulls."
